    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "事实：Alphabet 的经营重心仍然是 Google，且核心可分为 Google Services、Google Cloud 和 Other Bets；其中 Search/YouTube/Cloud 是最明确的业务抓手。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204425000014",
            "index_id": "didx-72bfa3cea8523547",
            "block_id": "block-000093-77ff8c4e",
            "quote": "Alphabet is a collection of businesses — the largest of which is Google."
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204425000014",
            "index_id": "didx-72bfa3cea8523547",
            "block_id": "block-000448-57dcde7c",
            "quote": "We report Google in two segments, Google Services and Google Cloud; we also report all non-Google businesses collectively as Other Bets."
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204425000014",
            "index_id": "didx-72bfa3cea8523547",
            "block_id": "block-000096-947ab541",
            "quote": "Google Search helps people find information... YouTube provides... Google Cloud helps customers solve today’s business challenges"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "事实：按 2024 年收入和经营利润看，Google Services 仍是最重要的价值来源，且盈利贡献远高于 Google Cloud；Cloud 已是第二增长引擎，但基数和利润规模仍明显小于 Services。",
        "citations": [
          {
