            "index_id": "didx-72bfa3cea8523547",
            "block_id": "block-000561-617a0dd5",
            "quote": "an increase of 14% year over year, primarily driven by... Google Services revenues... 12%, and... Google Cloud revenues... 31%."
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204425000014",
            "index_id": "didx-72bfa3cea8523547",
            "block_id": "block-000512-1e5177d1",
            "quote": "Google Cloud revenues are comprised of the following:"
