      },
      {
        "text": "事实：AI 既是增长机会，也是下行风险来源；公司明确把 AI 竞争、AI 失误/偏差、监管、诉讼、声誉和安全问题列为可能伤害业务与经营结果的因素。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204425000014",
            "index_id": "didx-72bfa3cea8523547",
            "block_id": "block-000452-5008754c",
            "quote": "we face increasing competition... including from other developers and providers of AI products and services"
