            "index_id": "didx-72bfa3cea8523547",
            "block_id": "block-000278-45549c01",
            "quote": "systems and control failures, security breaches... could result in regulatory and legal exposure"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "事实：广告政策与隐私规则变化，尤其第三方 cookies 相关变化，可能影响广告业务表现；隐私和安全问题会直接威胁品牌、用户留存和财务结果。",
        "citations": [
